  "markdownContent": "# Greetings in Spanish\n\n| Spanish | English | IPA |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Hola | Hello | /ˈo.la/ |\n| Buenos días | Good morning | /ˈbwe.nos ˈði.as/ |\n| ¿Cómo estás? | How are you? (informal) | /ˈko.mo esˈtas/ |\n| Me llamo… | My name is… | /me ˈʝa.mo/ |\n| Mucho gusto | Nice to meet you | /ˈmu.tʃo ˈɣus.to/ |\n\nNote the silent **h** in *hola* and the soft **d** /ð/ between vowels in *días*.",
